    "text": "## sub_54CA00_0054ca00 — Mesh vertex material transform processor\n\n**Summary:** Processes a mesh's vertex element array, applying material-based UV/texture coordinate transforms to vertex data. Has two paths selected by a flags word: a 16-DWORD vertex stride path with D3D-transformed data, or a 12-DWORD stride path for untransformed data. Part of scene graph mesh rendering pipeline.\n\n**Frame-path:** NOT_FOUND  \n**Call frequency:** UNKNOWN (no static path from tick root)\n\n**Called by:** PriorityQueueRecursiveProcess (00544db0)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| this | 0x14 | RW | — | Flags word; bit 27 (0x8000000) guards re-entry, bit 23 (0x800000) selects vertex stride path, bit 25/26/5 also set |\n| this | 0x118 | R | — | Vertex element count (guard > 0 for main processing loop) |\n| this | 0x11C | R | — | Vertex element array pointer (64-byte stride per entry) |\n| this | 0x138 | R | — | Sub-object pointer; checked for flag bit 4 at +0x3C to select stride constant (18 vs 34) |\n| this | 0x174 | R | — | Sub-object property/member used by callers |\n\n**Written-by note (persistence):**\n- this 0x14: ORed with 0x9000020 at end (done flags); separate guard bit 0x8000000 prevents re-entry\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n| 0054d00c | jpt_54CBC0 | R | Jump table for 16-DWORD stride switch cases |\n| 0054d01c | jpt_54CE21 | R | Jump table for 12-DWORD stride switch cases |\n| 00800000 | unk_800000 | R | Constant 0x800000 flag to select 16-DWORD vertex stride path |\n| 008b78a0 | dword_8B78A0 | R | SoundManager [DERIVED] |\n| 008b8f28 | dword_8B8F28 | R | UIRootContextPtr [DERIVED] (also: ` — unknown context/state pointer) |\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 00540940 | sub_540940 | Checks/waits on audio resource state via SoundManager |\n| 005472d0 | FloatToIntSwitch | Converts float value to int (flags/color packing) |\n| 0054e0e0 | SingleCallWrapper_e0e0 | Wrapper that calls a single function with element data |\n| 0054e0f0 | Wrapper_e0f0 | Wrapper for element post-processing |\n| 0054fc70 | sub_54FC70 | Handles per-element index/offset during texture coordinate transform |\n| 0055d720 | sub_55D720 | Processes/updates UI context state |\n\n**Guard conditions:** Entry guard: if `this[5] & 0x8000000` is nonzero, BLOCKED entirely (function returns 0). PASSES only when guard bit is clear. Inner guard: if `this[70]` (element count at +0x118) <= 0, BLOCKED: jumps to end, sets done flags, returns. If > 0, PASSES: enters main 64-byte-stride loop over vertex elements. Per-element guard: if element's internal pointer at +32 is null, BLOCKED: entire material/vertex transform block skipped for that element.\n"
